    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Roxy grew up in the bayous surrounding New Orleans despite her family's old society lineage, and it was this love of the swamps that drew the attention of Jared, then-leader of New Orleans' @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.zCWdD1NpOCn03CwE]{Gangrel}, who watched her for years before finally Embracing her. Jared taught her Kindred politics and introduced her to his allies, including the mad @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.ZJx9H3XnU8yQGy9s]{Malkavian}-turned-outcast Uriah Travers and the Uktena tribe of Garou, whose treaty with the @UUID[Compendium.vtmlarp.clans.JournalEntry.zCWdD1NpOCn03CwE]{Gangrel} Jared had personally brokered. When Prince Doran was assassinated in 1955 and Jared was blamed and destroyed in a Blood Hunt, Roxy fled into the bayous under Travers' protection, certain her sire had been framed. She later returned to take over clan leadership and has spent decades since quietly gathering the secrets of New Orleans' Kindred politics, convinced that Prince Marcel was somehow responsible for Doran's death and Jared's ruin. She uses her accumulated knowledge as leverage rather than for coin, and has spent years maneuvering closer to Marcel in search of proof.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Vague and evasive when questioned &mdash; you trade information for information, and you're always probing to see whether the person you're speaking to knows anything that could link Marcel to Doran's murder.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Animalism 3, Auspex 2, Celerity 3, Fortitude 2, Obfuscate 1, Protean 5.</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Jared (destroyed in a Blood Hunt for Doran's murder, which Roxy believes was a frame-up). Haven: City Park. Secrets rating: A.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
